<title>UK: UK to rule on Bass deal this week-analysts.</title>
<headline>UK to rule on Bass deal this week-analysts.</headline>
<byline>Tim Farrand</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry is expected to decide this week whether a proposed merger between brewer to hotels group Bass Plc and Carlsberg-Tetley should be allowed to go ahead, said analysts on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a market rumour that it will be this week,&quot; said Colin Davies, an analyst at Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p>&quot;Everyone seems to think the 12th(of June)but we shall see,&quot; said one analyst who declined to be named. &quot;So we will just watch our screens at eleven and three.&quot;</p>
</text>
